msgid "Multiple global config.php files detected"
msgstr "Beberapa file global config.php terdeteksi"

#: includes/class-grabwp-tenancy-status-checker.php:206
msgid "Pro global configuration exists at both new and legacy locations. Boot loads the new path first; changes saved to the other copy are silently ignored. Remove the unused copy."
msgstr "Konfigurasi global Pro ada di lokasi baru dan lama. Boot memuat jalur baru terlebih dahulu; perubahan yang disimpan ke salinan lain diabaikan secara diam-diam. Hapus salinan yang tidak digunakan."

#: includes/class-grabwp-tenancy-status-checker.php:216
msgid "Data directory inside uploads/"
msgstr "Direktori data di dalam uploads/"

#: includes/class-grabwp-tenancy-status-checker.php:217
msgid "Tenant data is inside wp-content/uploads/ — exposed to media upload scanners, backup tools, and CDN sync. Recommended: wp-content/grabwp-tenancy/."
msgstr "Data tenant berada di dalam wp-content/uploads/ - terekspos ke pemindai unggahan media, alat cadangan, dan sinkronisasi CDN. Direkomendasikan: wp-content/grabwp-tenancy/."

#: includes/class-grabwp-tenancy-status-checker.php:226
msgid "Pro config directory inside uploads/"
msgstr "Direktori config Pro di dalam uploads/"

